  "content": "\n\n# 游標擴展\n\n<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" alt=\"預設\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/default.png\" />\n<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" alt=\"指針手形\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/pointing_hand.png\" />\n<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" alt=\"抓取\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/grabbing.png\" />\n<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" alt=\"I型游標\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/ibeam.png\" />\n<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" alt=\"位移\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/shift.png\" />\n<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" alt=\"忙碌\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/busy.gif\" />\n<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" alt=\"不允許\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/not_allowed.png\" />\n<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" alt=\"十字準線\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/crosshair.png\" />\n<img width=\"33\" height=\"33\" alt=\"全方位縮放\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/resize_all.png\" />\n<img width=\"33\" height=\"33\" alt=\"水平縮放\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/resize_ew.png\" />\n<img width=\"33\" height=\"33\" alt=\"垂直縮放\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/resize_ns.png\" />\n<img width=\"33\" height=\"33\" alt=\"對角線縮放(NW-SE)\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/resize_nwse.png\" />\n<img width=\"33\" height=\"33\" alt=\"對角線縮放(NE-SW)\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/resize_nesw.png\" />\n\n以 Minecraft 風格的游標取代枯燥的舊版系統預設游標。\n\n在 1.21.9 為模組引入大量破壞性變更之前，此模組曾名為 [Minecraft Cursor](https://github.com/fishstiz/minecraft-cursor/blob/master/README.md)。\n\n## 📌 需求\n\n- 於 Fabric 平台：Fabric API\n\n## ✨ 功能\n\n- 使用資源包自訂游標貼圖。\n- 透過自訂動畫讓您的游標活起來。\n- 包含適合其他情境的額外游標形狀。\n- 透過 [**舊版模式**](https://fishstiz.github.io/minecraft-cursor-wiki/resource-pack/getting-started#all-cursors) 強化各種 GUI 元素的游標邏輯。\n- 可依個人喜好調整多項選項。前往「模組」畫面，或至「選項 › 控制設定 › 滑鼠設定 › 游標設定」。\n\n![cursors_extended](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/o5fhgLeQ/images/6d6d002908e179dbfe11096af85f1f9a37d71189.gif)\n\n## 🖌️ 建立資源包\n\n建立專屬的資源包，分享至支援的平台，並有機會在此 [展示](https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/resource-pack/showcase)！\n\n<a href=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/resource-pack/showcase\" target=\"_blank\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fishstiz/resources/refs/heads/main/cursors-extended/showcase.gif\" width=\"100%\" alt=\"展示\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/bedrock-style-cursors\" target=\"_blank\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/dUA5FyFq/images/28f9504fa044c59491a1555494b3e579eec186a1.png\" width=\"100%\" alt=\"岩殼風格游標\"/>\n</a>\n\n---\n\n已為 Minecraft Cursor v3 製作過資源包嗎？使用 [**V3 轉換工具**](https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/tools/#v3-converter) 進行轉換。\n\n立即開始：https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/resource-pack/getting-started",
  "contentType": "text/markdown",
  "type": "modrinth"
}
